[Here is mine](https://imgur.com/ubl3VXm), probably not the cleanest but it works well for me even though I'm only lvl 55, and keeps my abilities on easy-to-reach keys. Shift, ctrl, and alt are all mapped to different buttons on my mouse. I also have two vertical bars on the left side but they're hidden, I don't really need them. They're really for if I need like...macros or something later.

&amp;#x200B;

I could likely get by with two sets of 3 bars, but with how I have things set up with my keys/f keys I need even numbers of bars or I get confused.

&amp;#x200B;

edit: oh yeah, I forgot to hit a stance, but my oath gauge/other job gauges goes right in that nice little empty spot to the right of my bars.
